      "title": "Qwen3.8-27B Math: What Thinking Mode Actually Buys You",
      "preview_text": "A controlled follow-up to our Qwen3.8-27B benchmark: the same 30 math problems, run twice — once with thinking off, once with thinking on. The reasoning budget recovers six problems (50% → 70%), but",
      "cover_media": {
        "id": "QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHP6f2i6WsAAKAAIAAAAAAGJ0igAA",
        "media_id": "2089283036579803136",
